# Brand design tokens

Match existing CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css`. Do not invent a new palette (no purple-on-white, no cream+terracotta).

## Colors
| Token | Value |
|-------|--------|
| background | `#F0FDFA` |
| background-end | `#FFFFFF` |
| foreground | `#0F172A` |
| primary | `#0891B2` / `rgb(8, 145, 178)` |
| primary-dark | `#0E7490` |
| primary-soft | `#CFFAFE` |
| secondary | `#134E4A` |
| success | `#10B981` |
| base (muted) | `#64748B` |
| accent (badge only) | `#FFCC01` |

## Usage
- Prefer Tailwind tokens: `bg-primary`, `text-primary-dark`, `bg-primary-soft`, `text-base`, etc.
- Page atmosphere: soft cyan radial gradients + light grid (already on `body`) — keep new screens consistent
- Shadows: `shadow-brand` / `shadow-brand-lg` from `tailwind.config.ts`
- Fonts: body = Plus Jakarta Sans (`font-sans`); display/headings = Sora (`font-display`)

## UI habits
- Mobile-first; bottom nav exists for small screens
- Order page: sticky summary + confirmation modal before submit
- Avoid card clutter in heroes; one job per section
